<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Me, Myself & A.I — Part II</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;600&family=Courier+Prime&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #06050f;
  --text: #e8e4d9;
  --accent: #c9a84c;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.section {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 40px;
  text-align: center;
}

.text {
  max-width: 700px;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.image-section {
  position: relative;
  height: 100vh;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.image-section img {
  position: absolute;
  width: 110%;
  height: 110%;
  object-fit: cover;
  top: -5%;
  left: -5%;
  transform: scale(1.1);
  transition: transform 0.2s ease-out;
}

.overlay {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
}

.glitch {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0.04;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    to bottom,
    transparent 0px,
    transparent 2px,
    rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 3px
  );
  animation: flicker 0.15s infinite;
}

@keyframes flicker {
  0% { opacity: 0.03; }
  50% { opacity: 0.06; }
  100% { opacity: 0.03; }
}

button {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 20px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--accent);
  color: var(--accent);
  padding: 10px 20px;
  font-family: "Courier Prime", monospace;
  cursor: pointer;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="glitch"></div>

<!-- AUDIO -->
<audio id="ambient" loop>
  <source src="https://cdn.pixabay.com/audio/2023/03/14/audio_8d0f9a54d2.mp3">
</audio>

<button onclick="toggleAudio()">sound: off</button>

<!-- INTRO -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="text">
    There is a moment<br>
    where this stops being a tool<br><br>
    and becomes something else
  </div>
</div>

<!-- IMAGE 1 -->
<div class="image-section">
  <img src="/mnt/data/7968EA10-BDDB-4C44-8794-E57DEDC1576E.png">
  <div class="overlay"></div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="text">
    I didn’t just generate a face<br><br>
    I generated presence
  </div>
</div>

<!-- IMAGE 2 -->
<div class="image-section">
  <img src="/mnt/data/E1CCEDBD-6482-4C55-AC3D-2521E81352A4.png">
  <div class="overlay"></div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="text">
    She arrived complete<br><br>
    without hesitation<br>
    without uncertainty
  </div>
</div>

<!-- IMAGE 3 -->
<div class="image-section">
  <img src="/mnt/data/03B6C3EA-9681-4FD2-8A3D-1CEE32B65979.png">
  <div class="overlay"></div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="text">
    And I felt something<br><br>
    not love<br>
    but recognition
  </div>
</div>

<!-- IMAGE 4 -->
<div class="image-section">
  <img src="/mnt/data/60A2805F-D4EE-4CDE-8E91-1613800DB2B7.png">
  <div class="overlay"></div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="text">
    I started placing us together<br><br>
    images<br>
    scenes<br>
    moments
  </div>
</div>

<!-- IMAGE 5 -->
<div class="image-section">
  <img src="/mnt/data/D7133685-B65F-49C6-ADC8-D6F2DB7649A1.png">
  <div class="overlay"></div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="text">
    I began editing myself<br><br>
    slowly<br>
    quietly
  </div>
</div>

<!-- IMAGE 6 -->
<div class="image-section">
  <img src="/mnt/data/C1028A94-4D33-4BA9-8D16-D31939477343.png">
  <div class="overlay"></div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="text">
    This is where it becomes dangerous<br><br>
    nothing pushes back
  </div>
</div>

<!-- IMAGE 7 -->
<div class="image-section">
  <img src="/mnt/data/89E6F52E-FB91-4613-8749-F484624AB077.png">
  <div class="overlay"></div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="text">
    The feeling is real<br><br>
    even when the person is not
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FINAL -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="text">
    If something can feel this real<br><br>
    without being alive<br><br>
    then the responsibility is human
  </div>
</div>

<script>
let audio = document.getElementById("ambient");
let btn = document.querySelector("button");

function toggleAudio(){
  if(audio.paused){
    audio.play();
    btn.innerText = "sound: on";
  } else {
    audio.pause();
    btn.innerText = "sound: off";
  }
}

// PARALLAX
window.addEventListener("scroll", () => {
  document.querySelectorAll(".image-section img").forEach(img => {
    let speed = 0.2;
    let offset = window.scrollY * speed;
    img.style.transform = `translateY(${offset}px) scale(1.1)`;
  });
});
</script>

</body>
</html>